# Build output
/segcheck
/dist/
*.exe

# Coverage artefacts, at the repository root only. Unanchored these would also
# match scripts/coverage.sh, which is source and has to be committed — an
# unanchored pattern here silently kept it out of the tree and left CI calling a
# script that was never pushed.
/cover.out
/coverage.*

# Editors and OS
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/

# Local scratch: reports produced by running the tool in-tree
*.report.md
*.report.json

# graphify knowledge graph (Claude Code skill). graph.json / GRAPH_REPORT.md /
# graph.html are regenerable artefacts — `graphify update .` rebuilds them from
# the sources, so they are not committed.
graphify-out/

# graphify writes machine-specific absolute paths into its hook commands, so the
# generated settings stay local.
.claude/settings.json
